UNRESOLVED — Assets/Animated Loading Icons/
--------------------------------------------

This pack ships with vendor documentation but no licence file, and its origin has not
been confirmed. If it came from the Unity Asset Store, redistributing it in a public
repository is likely to breach the Asset Store EULA, which generally prohibits
distributing pack contents in a form third parties can extract — which is precisely what
a public repository does.

This is a separate problem from the licensing of Skylotus Studios' own code, and choosing
this notice does not resolve it. Until its provenance is confirmed, either remove the pack
from the repository or make the repository private. See CORE_FIXES.md.


